+### Push notifications
+
+Push notifications are enabled when a VAPID key pair is configured:
+
+```sh
+VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=... VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=... bin/dev
+```
+
+You can generate a key pair with:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'puts WebPush.generate_key.to_h'
+```
+
 ## SaaS gem
 
