+#### Push Notifications (optional)
+
+To let people receive notifications as push notifications on their phones and desktops, set a VAPID key pair:
+
+- `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY`
+- `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`
+
+You can generate a key pair with:
+
+```sh
